  preOpLines: []
  surgeryLines: []
  intermissionLines:
  - speaker: 'Narrator '
    text: Inside the frontier town of Spellshire at the local tavern is where this
      story begins. A nurse enters the mostly empty tavern in the early morning and
      your setting up for another day of serving patrons.
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Welcome to the humble tavern of Spellshire, what are looking for at a
      tavern this early in the morning? '
  - speaker: Nurse
    text: Hello I'm [name] and saw the job notice for a nurse here.
  - speaker: Player
    text: Yes, I've been looking to hire a nurse recently due to the amount of injured
      adventurers coming to the tavern recently and don't have the knowledge on how
      to help them.
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'I''m looking for a nurse to guide and assist me on using magic to heal
      adventurers. I''ve only used it to slay monsters back in my adventuring days
      but now I need help on how to use my skills to heal instead. '
  - speaker: Nurse
    text: 'Well this sounds like a job I can handle let me guide you through some
      of the basics.  '
  woundLayout: []
